cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Verification code for: Anyon braiding at the speed limit"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Marashdeh
    given-names: Mohammad F.
    affiliation: "Department of Mathematics, Mutah University, Al-Karak, Jordan"
    email: marashdeh@mutah.edu.jo
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22238459
date-released: 2026-09-01
repository-code: "https://github.com/alhafs-hue/anyon-speed-limit"
abstract: >-
  Scripts reproducing every computational claim in "Anyon braiding at the speed
  limit": the closed-form four-strand second-moment spectrum, the two-generator
  bound on a qubit, the exact design orders of the finite braid images, the
  crossing counts, and the exact n = 6 Ising spectrum.
keywords:
  - anyons
  - braid groups
  - unitary designs
  - frame potential
  - Temperley-Lieb algebra
  - topological quantum computation
